{"game": "the-anacrusis", "language": "english", "appid": 1120480, "month": "2023-07", "window": 2, "start_date": 1688774400, "end_date": 1689465599, "month_true_total": 33, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-03 00:44:29 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "142096895", "author": {"steamid": "76561198947048083", "personaname": "BBSqeebles", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198947048083/", "num_games_owned": 160, "num_reviews": 49, "playtime_forever": 893, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 602, "last_played": 1701836014, "avatar": "a86e3e64979b7708348b74bfb37ba97fb5c5a025"}, "language": "english", "review": "good", "timestamp_created": 1689381378, "timestamp_updated": 1689381378, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "141990931", "author": {"steamid": "76561198155021792", "personaname": "G37 PWN3D", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/G37PWN3D/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 886, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 789, "last_played": 1695583807, "avatar": "3604ac34b47c87e187d151f22aa17e107253ce34"}, "language": "english", "review": "SO MUCH POTENTIAL. Only about 13 hours of playtime when writing this review. This game is awesome no lie. This is still a work in progress and not a full release yet, so of course expect bugs, and the issues that come with. I was able to play a couple games of versus with full lobbies and let me tell you about it. That was the most fun I've had playing a video game in a while.\n Picture this. Trying to escape to safety and steamrolling through thousands of aliens, while 4 blood thirsty Special Aliens (friends) are constantly re spawning plotting to tear you down any chance they get. Yeah. It gets INTENSE. The art style in this game is beautiful and fresh. I get a strong nostalgic feeling reminding me of my high school days playing L4D with my friends and cousins :')\n To the developers. You have something great here! The fact you guys are active in discord and respond to us shows that this game is going to be made with the community in mind and I will always stand behind that. I can't wait to see what the future is going to hold for this game.", "timestamp_created": 1689259756, "timestamp_updated": 1689259756, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 2, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "141985762", "author": {"steamid": "76561198031192681", "personaname": "thirsty", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/sicksicksicksicksicksick/", "num_games_owned": 383, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 17, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 17, "last_played": 1689189586, "avatar": "c51a962551be0d002631b2e4bfd57657ca7855c7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Abso-lutely", "timestamp_created": 1689255075, "timestamp_updated": 1689255075, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "141980432", "author": {"steamid": "76561198036411513", "personaname": "Waterdance", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Waterdance/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_r